      "message": "This seems wrong to me. A classpathFragment is NOT a prebuilt_etc module. It is certainly not prebuilt. It seems to be pretending to be one simply to try and reuse some code in the apex module for putting a file into the /etc directory in the APEX.\n\nI think it is better for the classpathFragment to refactor the apex functionality to allow the logic to copy the file into the /etc directory to be used for other types. Maybe do something similar to how apex handles compat_configs which also copies files into the etc directory in the apex.\n\nI know there is precedent for this as that is how the linkerConfig module is implemented. I don\u0027t know enough about linkerConfig to know whether that makes sense for it but the classpathFragment is not the same as linkerConfig.",
